its property card, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and that card is the note's only visible title. The card leads with[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a species glyph tile and a kicker word (ALBUM, RECORD, DAY, WEEK, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]QUARTER, YEAR), so an album, a record, and a day can never be [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]mistaken for each other, even in grayscale. The redundant H1, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]inline title, and nav line are hidden at render time, never deleted[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](except album H1s, which move into a bob-owned `title:` key). Every[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]failure restores native rendering.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]property_card_title_block.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/property_card_title_block.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-o6[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-o6/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Title-slot spike and kit mount primitive (go/no-go)[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]title-slot[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]title-slot: build the kit primitive that mounts a property card in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Obsidian's title slot (after the hidden inline title, before native [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Properties) in Live Preview and Reading, prove it with a real-Obsidian [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CDP spike on athena across switches, splits, re-renders, settings, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]teardown, record a GO or NO-GO verdict with evidence on this phase bead,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and deploy the unused primitive.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Identity kit: species tile, kicker, title row, rail, tokens, [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and title ownership[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]identity-kit[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity-kit: add the shared species registry, glyph tiles, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]kicker/title/subtitle row, docked rail with optional children strip, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]data-card-kind tokens and the temporal accent, and generalized title [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ownership (inline-title hide, Live Preview block hide with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reveal-on-selection-touch, Reading source hide) to the bob-ledger-tools [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]kit, with unit tests and a preview matrix; no card adopts it yet.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Album `title:` key, H1-less album create, and `bob albums [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]tidy`[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]album-title-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]album-title-cli: in bob-cli, make frontmatter `title:` the first title [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source for album notes in every reader, make bob albums create write [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`title:` and no H1, and add bob albums tidy (dry-run by default) that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]backfills `title:` from the H1 and removes the now-redundant H1 under [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-tidy keep rules, with registry, completion, docs, and no-churn [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync tests. No live-vault apply in this phase.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Album, record, and bank cards adopt the title block[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]collection-cards[dim] · [dim][/dim]after title-slot, identity-kit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]collection-cards: the album card and record card adopt the identity kit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the title slot (or body fallback per the title-slot verdict), the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]album card renders its title from local data and hides its redundant H1,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the album folds its schema to one line, the bank Setup card gains the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]BANK kicker, the Record Card and album card editor headers carry the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]species, docs follow, and the plugins deploy.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day and period cards always mount as the title block with a [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]docked rail[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]day-period-cards[dim] · [dim][/dim]after title-slot, identity-kit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]day-period-cards: the intention card becomes the day card and period [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]card: it always mounts on canonical daily, week, quarter, and year notes[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a path-computed title, leaf tile, temporal accent, state pill, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docked nav rail with children strip, and a set-intentions ghost on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]current and future subjects; recognized H1, nav, and child-link lines [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hide with reveal; content bands stay gated; docs, editor header, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deploy follow.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Real-Obsidian proof, preview matrix, live album tidy, and [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]final deploy[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]obsidian-proof[dim] · [dim][/dim]after collection-cards, day-period-cards, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]album-title-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]obsidian-proof: add and run a real-Obsidian title-block walkthrough on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]athena (ownership, reveal, fallback, heading links, Outline, byte [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]neutrality, grayscale, forced colors), render the full preview matrix, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fix what it finds, run the live bob albums tidy only when every host [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]runs a bob that reads album `title:`, pass every gate, and deploy the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]final tree.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Glossary updates the reviewer accepted[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]glossary[dim] · [dim][/dim]after obsidian-proof[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]glossary: apply only the memory decisions answered yes (glossary strands[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the optional decision record) so memory matches the shipped cards, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then run sase memory init; if every memory decision is no, record that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on this bead and change nothing.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-o6","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-o6.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-o6.1"},"source_run_id":"run-9176e995d79833720a70a1bac038770b","started_at":"2026-11-20T16:51:28.769353+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"d2fb6f18f842cb428fd61631d35ce1e5dfc1c570888fb858230b8a1374c4044f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-o6.2--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":8720},"commits":{"digest":"f2029be53dd7aafebd5fa035b06eaec3c7bd40bf51ba6ae7decb3b88abd29a0b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-o6.2--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows"